This software renders third-party map data at runtime. Deployments are responsible
for honoring the applicable data-source licenses, including but not limited to:

  - OpenStreetMap        © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL
  - OpenSeaMap seamarks  © OpenSeaMap contributors, ODbL (share-alike)
  - NOAA charts / bathymetry — U.S. Government work, public domain

MAP-ATLAS itself bundles no map tiles, no trained models, and no third-party data.
